    Candidate Language=MS-MY: Great. Now. With an offline account, if you forget your password, the only way to retrieve it is with a hint, so make sure it's memorable.
  \oobeLocalAccount\PasswordHintTitle:
    Candidate Language=MS-MY: Tambah pembayang untuk kata laluan anda
