    Candidate Language=MS-MY: Nampaknya anda tidak bersambung dengan Internet. Semak sambungan anda dan cuba lagi.
  \errors\NavigationBlockedVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=MS-MY: We cannot open that page right now. For security reasons, you will need to visit the page from a browser or a different device.
